        "\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta x}=-\\frac1{\\Delta x}\\int_x^{x+\\Delta x}E_x(s,y,z)\\,ds",
        "\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0^+}\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial x}=-E_x(x,y,z)",
        "dV=\\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial x}\\,dx=-E_x\\,dx",
